WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.453
Let's see how to add negative product targets to a new sponsored products campaign.

00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:09.224
If you're using product targeting, you'll find negative product targeting toward the end of creating

00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:09.861
your campaign.

00:00:09.861 --> 00:00:15.586
You can search for brands you don't want your ad to show against, and then click "Exclude." You

00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:20.994
can also exclude only certain products from your targeting, and there are three ways to do this.

00:00:20.994 --> 00:00:25.765
Search for products and click "Exclude," enter ASINs one by one, or upload a list.

00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:29.900
Now, when you launch your campaign, your ad won't show against these products.
